    "https://www.colby.edu/people/offices-directory/people-services/employment/academic-positions-available/": {
      "title": "Academic Positions Available",
      "description": "Academic Positions Available | Colby College Skip to Main Content Colby College logo Go to colby.edu homepage Colby Arts Libraries Visit Resources ColbyNow myColby Search Academics Admissions People Student Life Athletics and Recreation Alumni and Families News Events Colby College logo Go to colby.edu homepage Menu Menu Button Homepage People Offices Directory People Services Recruitment and Hiring Academic Positions Available Academic Positions Available Academic Positions Available People Services People Services Staff Recruitment and Hiring Staff Learning and Development Onboarding Benefits Environment, Health, and Safety Current Employees Performance Management Compensation Academic Positions Available Colby College logo Go to colby.edu homepage Colby Athletics logo Go to colbyathletics.com homepage Colby College 4000 Mayflower Hill Waterville, ME 04901 207-859-4000 Colby Athletics logo Go to colbyathletics.com homepage About Bookstore Campus Map Colby Magazine Dare Northward Dining Menus Employment Museum Privacy Policy Site Map Contact Colby Support Colby Newsletter instagram facebook linkedin x youtube tiktok NOTICE OF NONDISCRIMINATORY POLICY AS TO STUDENTS Colby College admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally accorded or made available to students at the school. It does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. See Colby's Nondiscrimination Policy and Compliance Information."
